            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Added
- **Reply to a Devin session from your iPhone.** Devin joins Claude Code and
  Codex as an agent you can type into remotely, in tmux or herdr. Stop isn't
  offered for Devin — its interrupt needs two presses of Escape, and a stray one
  at an idle prompt opens a menu that can undo work.

### Fixed
- Security and reliability improvements.
]]></description>
